<title>UK: BOE forecasts 1.9 bln stg shortage, offers help.</title>
<headline>BOE forecasts 1.9 bln stg shortage, offers help.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of England offered the UK money market an early round of assistance after forecasting a liquidity shortage of around 1.9 billion stg.</p>
<p>The operations will comprise a repo to May 12, and outright offers of bills also maturing on or before May 12. The Bank's repo rate was unchanged at 6.0 percent.</p>
